+/* SPU2-X, A plugin for Emulating the Sound Processing Unit of the Playstation 2
+ * Developed and maintained by the Pcsx2 Development Team.
+ *
+ * Original portions from SPU2ghz are (c) 2008 by David Quintana [gigaherz]
